# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nikita Nazarov, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-09
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects Obfuscated Powershell via use Rundll32 in Scripts
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(winlog.event_id:"4697" AND (ServiceFileName:*&&* AND ServiceFileName:*rundll32* AND ServiceFileName:*shell32.dll* AND ServiceFileName:*shellexec_rundll*) AND (ServiceFileName:*value* OR ServiceFileName:*invoke* OR ServiceFileName:*comspec* OR ServiceFileName:*iex*))
